Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(web): show Hone status in the chat header and rate
 Pi replies

The header chip shows which AGENTS.md version Hone serves, how many sessions
wait for the next optimization, and whether one is running; it toasts when a
session reaches Hone or AGENTS.md changes. Pi replies get thumbs up and down
buttons whose comment is sent to Hone, visible without hover on the newest
reply.

